{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>He remembers</b> — when the enemy, who is the king of Chaldea, remembers them on account of their charge, they stumble in their going." "<b>They hasten</b> — to the walls of Nineveh." "<b>And prepared</b> — the great wooden towers. And Yefet said: when the king of Nineveh remembers his mighty men, they stumble, they flee to the wall and prepare shields to cover themselves, and this will not avail them, for."], :book :nahum, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nahum -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nachum"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:14:33.806288891Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}